---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
const updated = '15 October 2026';
---
<Page title="Privacy policy" eyebrow="Your data" lede={`How ${SITE.title} handles personal data. Last updated ${updated}.`}>
  <section class="wrap section">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
      <p>
        This website is run by {SITE.author}, astrologer (“I”). For any question about your data, write to
        <a id="mail" href="/faq/" data-u={SITE.email.user} data-d={SITE.email.domain}>{SITE.email.user} [at] {SITE.email.domain}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What I collect, and why</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Consultation orders.</strong> When you book, you send your name, e-mail, the session you chose and —
          for the reading — your date, time and place of birth (and your partner’s, for synastry), plus anything you
          write in the message. I use this only to arrange and prepare your consultation and to reply to you
          (legal basis: taking steps at your request before a contract, Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR).
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Gift vouchers.</strong> Your details and the recipient’s name, and their e-mail if you want the
          voucher sent to them — used only to deliver the voucher.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Newsletter.</strong> Your e-mail (and first name, if given), used only to send the monthly
          newsletter, based on your consent (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR). You can unsubscribe at any time.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>The free forecast</h2>
      <p>
        The free forecast is calculated entirely in your own browser. The birth data you enter there is not sent to
        any server and is not stored by me. If you go on to book, it is kept only in your browser tab to pre-fill the
        booking form.
      </p>

      <h2>Where the data is processed</h2>
      <p>
        Forms on this site are delivered through Netlify, Inc., which hosts the website and processes form submissions
        on my behalf. Correspondence takes place by e-mail. Your data is not sold, shared with third parties for
        marketing, or used for anything other than the purposes above.
      </p>

      <h2>How long it is kept</h2>
      <p>
        Consultation data is kept for as long as needed to provide the consultation and answer follow-up questions,
        and deleted on request. Newsletter addresses are kept until you unsubscribe.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
      <p>
        This site sets no advertising or tracking cookies. Fonts are served from this website itself. Embedded YouTube
        videos use the privacy-enhanced youtube-nocookie.com domain.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You have the right to access, correct or delete your data, to restrict or object to its processing, to data
        portability, and to withdraw consent at any time. You may also lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority —
        in Croatia, the Personal Data Protection Agency (AZOP).
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>
<script>
  const a = document.getElementById('mail') as HTMLAnchorElement | null;
  if (a) {
    const addr = `${a.dataset.u}@${a.dataset.d}`;
    a.href = `mailto:${addr}`;
    a.textContent = addr;
  }
</script>
